    """F1 — Deut 11:1-7: love and keep (11:1 — demand_declared by kind, VARIANT); the discipline seen (11:2 — the noun's one Torah seat; GL by CALL); signs and deeds (11:3 — plague_struck TEN by kind); the sea flowed over them (11:4 — sea_returned by kind, the hiphil's one seat); the wilderness (11:5 — THE STATE ROW, SUPPLIED with no write); Dathan and Abiram (11:6 — earth_swallowed by kind, KR and SC by CALL); KORAH UNNAMED (the tape already reads the verse as the chapter does); every living thing (the flood's word — PR by CALL); your eyes have seen (11:7 — SN by CALL; Joshua's and Judges' epilogue read from it)"""
    del P_[:]
    ask = case['ask']
    if ask == 'love_and_keep':
        ink('11:1', '"AND YOU SHALL LOVE the LORD your God AND KEEP HIS CHARGE, His statutes, His judgments and His commandments always" — "and you shall love the LORD your God" the two seats %s; "and you shall love" the Torah\'s four %s; "keep His charge" the ONE SEAT %s (Numbers 3:7 the priests\' "his charge" the lemma\'s other form); the four nouns the book\'s form; the register SINGULAR %s; the shared run with 30:16 %d, 6:5 %d' % (P('ואהבת', 'את', 'יהוה', 'אלהיך'), U('ואהבת', books=T), P('ושמרת', 'משמרתו'), NUM[1], SH(D11(1), ('Deut', 30, 16)), SH(D11(1), ('Deut', 6, 5))))
        move('cold_run_second_tablets (CALL) — ST.what_the_lord_asks(what_does_the_lord_ask) = %s; cold_run_hear_o_israel (CALL) — HI.the_creed(love_and_fear) = %s' % (ST_ASK[0][:60], HI_LOVE[0][:60]), "10:12's five infinitives (demand_declared on the tape at Deut 10:12 — fear_of_heaven_asked on Israel UNMOVED) and 6:5's creed (shema_commanded on Israel UNMOVED): the readback row 11:1 VARIANT by kind against demand_declared — 'His charge' the book's one seat")
